sequenceDiagram
    participant A
    participant B
    A->B: solid line
    A-->B: dotted line
    A->>B: solid arrow
    A-->>B: dotted arrow
    B-xA: solid cross
    B--xA: dotted cross
    A-)B: async
    A--)B: async dotted
    A<<->>B: both ways
    A<<-->>B: both ways dotted
    B->>B: self
